    "purchase.benefits": {"extractionState":"manual","localizations":{"ja":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"複数プロジェクトで地点を管理し、精度や記録元で絞って一括で書き出せます。"}},"en":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Manage multiple projects, then filter and batch export points by accuracy or source."}},"zh-Hans":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"管理多个项目，按精度或来源筛选，并批量导出点位。"}}}},
